talRec}$ 分别见 [[68-df-partial-recursive-function-class]]、[[68-df-recursive-function]]。使用 [[68-thm-s-m-n-theorem]] 和 [[68-thm-shoenfield-recursion-theorem]] 的本地编号。$m=0$ 或 $k=0$ 时相应输入元组为 $()$。"},{"id":"d625bf896919d407","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 是全递归函数，见 [[68-df-recursive-function]]；$\\varphi_e$ 见 [[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]。使用 [[68-thm-shoenfield-recursion-theorem]] 的 k=1 情形。"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-153","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-shoenfield-recursion-theorem]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-shoenfield-recursion-theorem]] 保留原自指不动点陈述。[[68-thm-recursion-theorem-with-parameters]] 则给出参数到索引的全递归函数，其推导只使用本包已有的 Shoenfield 递归定理和 s-m-n 定理。原包中的二者已具有不同的文件别名，本轮保持不变。"}],"outgoing":["c524671590651be2","bca7d0eca4017dc7","5f5b8b347f696f58","3b8f02ef6e351ea3"]}